| (no pin) | n/a | n/a | the recording light has no chip pin: see section 9 |
| DBG_TX / DBG_RX | P1.15 / P1.16 | B4 / B5 | test pad on DBG_TX only: the debug log is send-only; DBG_RX not connected (pad TP2 dropped, ball B5 stays unconnected) |
